{"articleNo":"363821","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=363821&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [도서관] 2022 독서인증제 참여 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.04.27","hit":"25673","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwehAWCHECyBzAEgdQIoHkCOAHAEQBcArAKQBUyAFAUQA8BXAOwDoS8kg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2022 독서인증제 참여 안내</span></b><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">도서관에서는</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> 공학적 지식에 인문학적 소양을 겸비한 창의· 융합형 인재 양성을 위해</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 독서인증제를 운영하고 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 학부 재학생은 독서인증제 선정도서를 최소 한 학기 한 책 독서 후, 원스톱서비스에서</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 독후감 제출로 도서별&nbsp; 지도교수의 평가를 받고, 독서인증을 받으시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; □ 학부 재학생 참여기간:&nbsp; 2022.3.1.(화) ~ 2023.1.16.(월)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; □ 독서인증제 선정도서(183종):&nbsp; 도서관 3층 테마존 비치</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; □ 독서인증제 선정도서목록:&nbsp; 도서관홈페이지 &gt; 독서포털 &gt; 독서인증제 도서</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; □ 우수참여자:&nbsp; 총장상 및 부상 시상, 금오 인재상(BISkit) 마일리지 점수 부여(건당20)</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
